  "ordinaryQuizNegativeFallbackSafety": "30 word titles: Five titles changed: 流行る, 活力, 治す, 洋品店 and 法則. All 122 inherited direct entries remain in EN order; six RU-only entries follow them (128 total). Four were judged required for the displayed labels, two conservative without established necessity: 涼む→休む and 洋品店→商店. ショップ→売り場 rests on a defensible Russian place-of-sale reading, not an identical dictionary gloss. 泊める→泊まる was removed because lodging provider and guest are different. The three exact segment overlaps are already guarded; this is not proof of exhaustive runtime quiz safety. Tag/random fallback choices, voice/reading modes and drawing not cleared.",
